{"abstract":[{"text":"Understand the two backend systems that power PSReader content.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/replica-and-feed-editions"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/replica-and-feed-editions"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"PSReader"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Replica and Feed Editions"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Getting-Started"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PSReader SDK supports two distinct backend systems for delivering digital"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"publication content. Which system your publications use determines the content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types you configure, the analytics events you receive, and which delegate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"methods the SDK calls.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Consult the PageSuite portal or your account manager to determine which system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applies to your publications."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Shortcodes","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Shortcodes"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"shortcode"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is a remote configuration set up in the PageSuite portal that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maps to your publication setup. When you use a shortcode with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK fetches this configuration and automatically populates the correct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publications — routing to either the feed or replica system as appropriate."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"recommended approach","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for loading content. You don’t need to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"manage GUIDs yourself or know which backend system your publications use — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shortcode handles it. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Carousel-Setup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for more detail on configuring","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sections.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Feed Editions","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Feed-Editions"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Feed editions are the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"modern","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" content system. They deliver a mix of HTML"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"article templates and PDF pages, enabling responsive layouts that adapt to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different screen sizes and orientations. Key advantages over replica editions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"include:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich templates"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — elaborate article layouts such as multi-column templates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that go beyond a static PDF reproduction."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In-flow advertising"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — greater support for ads placed directly within","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"article content.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Faster backend"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — improved content delivery for quicker load times."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Feed edition publications are identified by a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"publication GUID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" issued","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the feed system. When configuring sections manually (without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shortcode), use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".feedArchive"},{"type":"text","text":" content type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .feedArchive(guid: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Replica Editions","level":2,"anchor":"Replica-Editions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica editions are the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"legacy"}]},{"type":"text","text":" content system. They deliver PDF-only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pages that reproduce the print layout of a publication. Users navigate through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a faithful digital replica of the printed product."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica publications have their own "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"publication GUID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — a different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value from a migrated title’s feed GUID. When configuring sections manually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(without a shortcode), use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaArchive"},{"type":"text","text":" content type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .replicaArchive(guid: \"REPLICA_PUBLICATION_GUID\")))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Transition","level":2,"anchor":"Transition","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PageSuite is transitioning publications from the replica system to feed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editions. New publications are typically set up as feed editions, while","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"existing replica publications may be migrated over time. Your account manager","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can advise on the timeline and steps for any migration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Impact-on-the-SDK","text":"Impact on the SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The backend system affects several areas of the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Content types","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Use "},{"code":".feedArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for feed editions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".replicaArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for replica editions when configuring sections manually."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":".dynamicArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a shortcode to let the SDK choose automatically."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analytics events","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Feed editions emit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition*"},{"type":"text","text":" events; replica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions emit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica*"},{"type":"text","text":" events. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Paywall delegate methods","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Separate delegate methods exist for opening","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and downloading feed vs replica editions. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywall-Integration","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Share delegate methods","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — Separate methods handle sharing for feed pages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and replica spreads. See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Sharing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Audio delegate methods"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Separate methods handle TTS for feed pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and replica spreads. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Text-to-Speech"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Replica Reader Variants","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Replica-Reader-Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica editions can be displayed using one of two reader implementations:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Legacy reader"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the original PDF reader with its own navigation and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toolbar UI. Configured via ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Modern reader","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — a newer implementation whose look and feel matches the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"feed edition reader, providing a consistent experience across both systems.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The active reader is controlled by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default is currently "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (legacy), but will change to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" (modern)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in a future release. If you are starting a new integration, consider using the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modern reader from the outset.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Replica-and-Feed-Editions"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Carousel-Setup":{"role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[{"text":"Configure the carousel’s sections, content sources, and layout.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Carousel-Setup","title":"Carousel Setup","type":"topic","url":"\/doc